# pe100: the first box with over 10^12 discs where P(two blue) = 1/2.
# b(b-1) / n(n-1) = 1/2 is a Pell equation; each solution gives the next:
#   b' = 3b + 2n - 2,  n' = 4b + 3n - 3   (from b = 15, n = 21)
b = 15
n = 21
while n <= 1_000_000_000_000 {
  b, n = 3 * b + 2 * n - 2, 4 * b + 3 * n - 3
}
puts b
